 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "This is the final",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.064,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "part.",
   "start": 2.064,
   "end": 2.583,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Milo was back. The",
   "start": 2.883,
   "end": 4.148,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Keeper was locked away.",
   "start": 4.148,
   "end": 5.765,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And then\u2026 the server",
   "start": 5.765,
   "end": 7.172,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "restarted.",
   "start": 7.172,
   "end": 7.875,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "When everything loaded again\u2026",
   "start": 8.875,
   "end": 11.307,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the red door was",
   "start": 11.507,
   "end": 13.23,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "gone.",
   "start": 13.23,
   "end": 13.768,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's over! We're free!",
   "start": 14.068,
   "end": 15.753,
   "spk": "P"
  },
  {
   "text": "Milo? Are you okay?",
   "start": 16.753,
   "end": 18.865,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm fine. Never better.",
   "start": 19.165,
   "end": 20.552,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "But his shadow\u2026 didn't",
   "start": 21.052,
   "end": 22.815,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "look like Milo.",
   "start": 22.815,
   "end": 24.017,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "That night, the lights",
   "start": 25.217,
   "end": 26.958,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "went out.",
   "start": 26.958,
   "end": 27.671,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "One by one\u2026 the",
   "start": 28.171,
   "end": 29.478,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "players disappeared.",
   "start": 29.478,
   "end": 31.221,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Milo! We have to",
   "start": 35.021,
   "end": 36.237,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "get out of here!",
   "start": 36.237,
   "end": 37.453,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "But Milo didn't move.",
   "start": 37.753,
   "end": 40.143,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Did you really think\u2026",
   "start": 40.743,
   "end": 42.942,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "you could lock me",
   "start": 42.942,
   "end": 44.722,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "away?",
   "start": 44.722,
   "end": 45.245,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "When the door closed\u2026",
   "start": 46.145,
   "end": 48.212,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "I took the last",
   "start": 48.212,
   "end": 49.689,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "one who walked out.",
   "start": 49.689,
   "end": 51.559,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "Someone must stay. And",
   "start": 51.959,
   "end": 54.519,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "I chose him.",
   "start": 54.519,
   "end": 55.915,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "No\u2026 Milo. I know",
   "start": 57.715,
   "end": 59.233,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "you're still in there.",
   "start": 59.233,
   "end": 61.32,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Juno saw it.",
   "start": 61.72,
   "end": 63.448,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "In Milo's hand\u2026 was",
   "start": 63.648,
   "end": 65.357,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "her yellow jacket.",
   "start": 65.357,
   "end": 66.976,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "You carried that into",
   "start": 67.376,
   "end": 69.475,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "the dark\u2026 for me.",
   "start": 69.475,
   "end": 71.174,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "Juno\u2026 run! I can't\u2026",
   "start": 72.074,
   "end": 73.391,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "hold him!",
   "start": 73.391,
   "end": 74.015,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "No. Rule number three.",
   "start": 77.074,
   "end": 78.994,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "I never leave a",
   "start": 79.294,
   "end": 80.518,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "friend behind.",
   "start": 80.518,
   "end": 81.662,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "She grabbed his hand\u2026",
   "start": 81.962,
   "end": 83.593,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "and didn't let go.",
   "start": 83.593,
   "end": 84.991,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "No! Someone must\u2026 stay!",
   "start": 85.791,
   "end": 89.226,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "But the rule only",
   "start": 89.626,
   "end": 91.005,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "works\u2026 if you are",
   "start": 91.005,
   "end": 92.383,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "alone.",
   "start": 92.383,
   "end": 92.869,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "The shadow was ripped",
   "start": 93.869,
   "end": 95.539,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "out of Milo\u2026",
   "start": 95.539,
   "end": 96.493,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "and the red door",
   "start": 96.993,
   "end": 98.28,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "shattered. Forever.",
   "start": 98.28,
   "end": 99.809,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "The lights came back.",
   "start": 102.409,
   "end": 103.969,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And one by one\u2026",
   "start": 103.969,
   "end": 105.084,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "every player returned.",
   "start": 105.084,
   "end": 106.718,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "You came back for",
   "start": 107.118,
   "end": 108.112,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "me. Twice.",
   "start": 108.112,
   "end": 108.697,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "That's what friends do.",
   "start": 108.997,
   "end": 110.661,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "The red door was",
   "start": 113.109,
   "end": 114.557,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "never seen again.",
   "start": 114.557,
   "end": 116.096,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "But somewhere\u2026 in another",
   "start": 117.096,
   "end": 119.296,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "server\u2026",
   "start": 119.296,
   "end": 119.912,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "a blue door just",
   "start": 120.312,
   "end": 121.868,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "appeared.",
   "start": 121.868,
   "end": 122.744,
   "spk": "N"
  }
 ],
